    <p>The post also cites internal secure-code tests, the Chrome team, and Wiz. Those have no shared test and stay off this card.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Access and pricing</h2>
    <p>As of 28 October 2026, Google says:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Cyber defenders: a subset gets Carbon starting this week. Google will then add more trusted partners through the Fairwind Program.</li>
      <li>Developers, businesses, and everyday users: not yet. Google says it is gathering feedback and working on guardrails first, and will open Carbon in its products as soon as possible.</li>
    </ul>
